[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;37m  The body carries what a cold reader needs:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.505, "o", "\u001b[2m    · the defect, with the line that causes it\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.408, "o", "\u001b[2m    · a reproduction, run rather than described\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.406, "o", "\u001b[2m    · a proposed fix, and the alternative rejected\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.411, "o", "\u001b[2m    · acceptance criteria runnable at this issue's end\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.408, "o", "\u001b[2m    · cross-references labelled required vs optional\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.206, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;37m  So resolving it costs one read, not a link crawl.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
